# Intentionally tracked reproducibility inputs ------------------------------
# Do not add blanket rules for *.lock, *.json, corpus/, audit/, or fixtures/.
# Cargo.lock, fuzz/Cargo.lock, fuzz/corpus/**, audit/**, release-scope-1.0.json,
# RELEASE_SCOPE_1_0.md, and byte-hashed test fixtures are source evidence.
